ed with a lifetime warranty."],"pros":["Great value for money","Reliable build quality","Strong overall performance"],"cons":["May not suit every preference","Check our full review for trade-offs"],"root_gallery":"{https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D+qpCqm7L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t7ogxoXwL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xvEvc2k6L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nSdxDJSvL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D5MpT5d0L.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rZ22MZmvL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kC6GeFtYL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kL0KcypqL.SS125_PKplay-button-mb-image-grid-small_.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618JlTfHplL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wc6dYALLL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jVQ-vbECL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AnBIIjSoL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eTm2403UL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uV+KfojgL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fhc01FGyL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/e76ca1aa-15d4-4799-8027-d284738eb83f.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/42ca514a-92e2-4230-afe3-422bb914645e.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/48696a60-7240-4d58-ae10-72c36a22954e.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411YmxO+hpL.jpg,https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31kN0JwyZyL.jpg}"}